WEBVTT

00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:04.520
The year is 2205 A.D.

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:14.570
To annihilate the History Retrograde Army,
who scheme to alter history...

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:19.990
...we, who were born from swords...

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:24.460
...engage in mortal combat today as well!

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.040
<i>Meetings and partings (Yes! Yes!)</i>

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:32.210
<i>In the direction the sun rises (Yes! Yes!)</i>

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:42.730
<i>Now, let's move forward, one step at a time,</i>
<i>as each flower blossoms (Oh, yay!)</i>

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:47.770
"Touken Ranbu Hanamaru S2"

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:47.940
<i>(Woo!)</i>

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:55.530
<i>Rather than be anxious,</i>
<i>yes, it's better to believe</i>

00:00:55.530 --> 00:01:01.200
<i>Always rich in mind and spirit,</i>
<i>staying positive every day</i>

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:06.870
<i>Real strength is how we master what we each</i>

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:10.210
<i>Already have</i>

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:14.010
<i>If you try to rush virtue</i>

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:16.510
<i>It won't go well at all</i>

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:20.390
<i>Think as you look up at the sky</i>

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:25.730
<i>Step forward firmly, with assurance</i>

00:01:25.730 --> 00:01:27.020
<i>Ready, set! Ready, go!</i>

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:29.020
<i>In a Hanamaru way</i>

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:31.650
<i>Laugh and cry</i>

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:34.990
<i>Without reserve</i>

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:39.570
<i>Under the bright, sunny sky</i>

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:42.120
<i>When you reach</i>

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:45.330
<i>The next street</i>

00:01:45.330 --> 00:01:56.010
<i>Start walking again, one step at a time,</i>
<i>as each flower blossoms (Oh, woo!)</i>

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:00.840
Today is hot, so shall I undress?

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:04.450
It really is hot. I can feel a lot of
things rising, including my excitement.

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:08.640
More importantly, do you
want to eat <i>chimaki</i> together?

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:12.560
"This anime is about the
stories of the Hanamaru days

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:17.410
of a certain group of
Sword Warriors in a certain citadel."

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:28.330
Big Brother, are you going somewhere?

00:02:28.330 --> 00:02:31.540
It's nice outside,
so I thought I'd take a walk.

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:36.130
Oh, then can you buy some
snacks at the general store?

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:37.420
That's no problem.

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:38.600
Thanks.

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:41.750
Then, here's a list.

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:51.020
Big Brother! A-Are you okay?

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:52.680
I'm fine.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:58.110
The lintel is too low 
for us, don't you think?

00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:01.730
Yes. That is the fate of those who are tall.

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:15.920
Excuse me.

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:26.070
I cannot reach it...

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:29.000
Ouch...

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:33.690
What're you doing, Taroutachi?

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:37.270
My list ended up in the back there...

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:39.750
Oh? Then, I'll get it for you.

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:46.330
Here.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:47.580
Thank you very much.

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:49.460
It was nothing!

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:53.330
More importantly, Taroutachi,
you've got soot on your face.

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:55.440
Oh. Thank you.

00:03:56.150 --> 00:03:56.930
See ya!

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:09.100
Oh?

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:13.480
Please excuse me.

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:20.150
"General Store"

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:21.860
"Dried squid, Dried horse mackerel,
Salty fermented squid"

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:27.680
It's a little...

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:29.370
...cramped in here.

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:39.880
"Dried Squid"

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:41.840
Oh, Taroutachi-<i>san</i>!

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:42.510
Yes?

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:49.350
"Seaweed"

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:21.340
My body's big, too,
so this also happens to me sometimes!

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:24.670
Sorry, it's my fault for
calling to you out of the blue.

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:28.970
It's not your fault.
Thank you for helping me clean up.

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:37.600
Huh? This one's huge...

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:39.270
That one's Taroutachi's.

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:44.300
All right, I'll do this all at once!

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:48.700
Fudou, I don't think you'll be able to!

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:52.410
I'll... be... fine...

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:57.840
Fudou!

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:02.670
Oh, no! Look what I've done!

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:09.930
Oh, Big Brother.

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:15.020
Sorry, Taroutachi,
I got your futon and pajamas dirty...

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:17.280
Please use these for today!

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:29.030
It's too small...

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:40.930
Is that how that's supposed to look?

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:42.250
"Fudou"

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:51.550
I am very sorry.

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:54.430
Huh? About the clothes?

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:57.560
Because of how large my body is...

00:06:57.560 --> 00:07:01.730
Well, originally, it was because I got
your nightclothes dirty in the first place.

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:04.860
Big Brother's worried about how he's so big.

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:06.300
Really?

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:13.370
As you can see, my size makes
me too large for a human to use,

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:16.380
so I was dedicated to the gods.

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:19.560
For a sword, having no wielder

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:22.100
is the same as not existing in this world.

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:28.260
Is there any meaning in
having such a large body?

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:35.070
There is!

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:37.970
The bigger your body...

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:39.770
"Saké"

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:39.770
...the more liquor you can drink!

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:43.980
That's a good enough meaning. Isn't it?

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:49.280
Yeah, I don't think it's such
a bad thing to have a big body.

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:53.740
Yeah, if it's my job to risk
my life to protect Master,

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:56.110
then it's better if my body is bigger.

00:07:59.350 --> 00:08:02.310
I suppose that's one way to think about it.

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:08.050
We got a lot of resources
from today's expedition, didn't we?

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:11.050
Shall we go back?

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:12.850
Hm? What are you looking at?

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:14.760
Ooh, persimmons?

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:15.930
Those look good!

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:18.970
I want to take them home for my brothers.

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:22.020
We want to give some to Kuniyuki, too.

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:24.400
That's a good idea. But...

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:31.480
Let's see. This father 
will pick them for you.

00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:42.450
Hm... I cannot reach.

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:44.750
All right, then someone
can sit on my shoulders!

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:52.070
I-I can't reach...

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:00.590
I got it.

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:05.100
It's nice that you're so tall.

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:08.730
Thank you very much, Taroutachi-<i>san</i>.

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:13.130
Sometimes it's nice...

00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:15.020
...to be big, too.

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:19.050
I wonder if Kuniyuki will be surprised.

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:20.660
Welcome back.

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:26.100
Um, I made these with Iwatooshi.

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:30.950
It's because he said
he was jealous of us tall guys.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:33.420
Oh, nice!

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:35.050
Looks fun.

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:36.220
Do you want to try?

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:38.430
Yeah! Here I go!

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:40.800
Is this what it looks like
from Taroutachi's point of view?

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:42.890
It's an amazing view!

00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:47.140
I'll become as big as this someday, too!

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:56.530
Me next! Let me try, too!

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:57.790
Sayo, you take a turn, too. Come on.

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:00.410
U-Um...

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:01.820
Let's see. This father will, too.

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:04.080
You're good--

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:10.530
Man, it's so hot...

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:14.590
This heat is taking a toll...

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:18.630
It's a nice day today, too, isn't it?

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:21.130
Yes, very pleasant.

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:25.600
What? You're drinking
hot tea on a day like this?

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:30.100
It's stylish to drink hot tea
on hot days, you know.

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:44.540
I knew it. It's hot here, too.

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:46.790
Oh, you're all gathered here!

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:49.120
With this many, we've definitely got enough!

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:50.370
What're you talking about?

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:55.550
Since it's hot today, wanna have
a slightly different kind of sparring?

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:58.050
All right!

00:10:58.630 --> 00:11:01.340
We'll have group sparring today!

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:03.050
Group sparring?

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:05.970
Yup. But we won't use swords.

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:08.570
Today, we'll use these!

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:10.350
What are those?

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:13.810
I found them when I was organizing
the boxes in Master's room.

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:18.660
That's cold! Hey, what are you doing?

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:22.200
Water comes out instead of bullets.

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:23.820
Interesting!

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:26.450
All right, I'll give it a shot!

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:29.040
I... will decline.

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:30.460
What's up with you?

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:35.790
You running from the match because
you don't know how to use the weapon?

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:37.210
What did you say?

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:47.140
Wow...

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:50.350
Even if we use guns, I will not lose a match!

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:52.980
I accept your challenge!

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:54.570
Interesting!

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:58.940
Then, let's draw lots to make teams!

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:03.380
We'll definitely win.

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:08.250
There's no way I can lose if we use guns.

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:12.830
I didn't think the day would come when
I would have to fight against you, Kane-<i>san</i>.

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:15.470
Kunihiro, I won't hold back.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:17.630
I'll give it my all!

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:19.420
That's just what I wanted!

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:21.800
I'll show you the power 
of an authentic sword.

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:24.640
Nagasone-<i>niichan</i>, I won't lose!

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:27.810
Urashima. Hachisuka.

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:30.480
I won't bring my own feelings into a match.

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:33.110
Sorry, but I'm fighting seriously.

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:36.110
Don't look down on me
just because I'm a copy.

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:38.400
Well, how will we determine who wins?

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:41.570
Whoever gets wet will be out.

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:45.360
You win when the other
team loses all their players.

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:47.450
We'll start in five minutes.

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:49.470
Now, it's time to fight!

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:51.580
Yeah!

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:54.790
The other team seems pretty formidable.

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:56.790
We need to have a proper plan.

00:12:57.290 --> 00:13:00.050
Kashuu-<i>san</i>, do you have any ideas?

00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:01.010
Of course!

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:05.680
In this match, whoever can take
their opponents by surprise will win!

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:06.720
What should we do?

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:11.060
I see! So we'll use these, huh?

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:13.180
Whoever gets their opponent wet wins...

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:16.100
You're saying that we will use
every trick in the book to do that, huh?

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:17.690
That's right!

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:23.540
And so, the Sword Warriors' battle
without honor and humanity began.

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:28.740
Hachisuka-<i>niichan</i>, over there!

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:30.870
Yamanbagiri, huh?

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:33.900
All right, let's attack from both
sides so he won't notice us.

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:40.920
Shoot--

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:49.980
Hachisuka-<i>niichan</i>!

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:53.890
Urashima... run away...

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:56.190
I can't leave you, Hachisuka-<i>niichan</i>!

00:13:57.020 --> 00:13:59.880
I'm... already done for...

00:14:02.780 --> 00:14:04.270
Hachisuka-<i>niichan</i>!

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:06.360
Who in the world--

00:14:08.030 --> 00:14:09.070
No way...

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:12.540
You shot Hachisuka-<i>niichan</i>,
Nagasone-<i>niichan</i>?!

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:15.600
Because this is a battlefield.

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:20.090
Our plan worked.

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:22.910
Since Yamanbagiri is on our team,

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:25.950
you thought it was him when
you saw white cloth, didn't you?

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.760
Cowar--

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:31.930
There are no cowards
or anything on the battlefield.

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:38.150
Kashuu, above you!

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:39.850
What?!

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:42.450
Water balloons?

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:47.650
No one said water guns
were the only weapons.

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:49.320
Here I go!

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:50.360
Take that!

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:51.490
Oh no, I'll get wet!

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:54.620
I'll cover you!
Now, while you've got a chance!

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:56.910
Kashuu, we're retreating!

00:14:56.910 --> 00:14:58.120
Roger!

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:03.040
Nagasone-<i>niichan</i>...

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:08.480
Kane-<i>san</i>... even if you're my opponent,

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:09.880
I will not lose.

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:13.350
Interesting. Let's see
what you've got, Kunihiro!

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:27.560
They're tougher than I expected.

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:34.740
I didn't think I'd team up with you
without any orders from Master.

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:37.160
We decided by drawing lots,
so it can't be helped, can it?

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:41.200
What are you doing?

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:43.990
There you are!

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:52.180
It'll be annoying if we let him get away!

00:15:59.020 --> 00:15:59.810
Urashima?

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:06.690
Nagasone-<i>niichan</i>...

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:08.600
Can we...

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:11.150
...just say I won?

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:14.230
Urashima, shoot me.

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:18.080
Even if I don't,
we already know who won, right?

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:19.110
Shoot!

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:21.160
I shot Hachisuka.

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:26.090
Those who are not prepared to be shot
have no right to stand on the battlefield.

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:28.350
But this is just a game!

00:16:28.350 --> 00:16:34.760
No! This is a battle with the
pride of Sword Warriors on the line!

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:40.200
It's not bad to be taken down by you.

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:53.200
Nagasone-<i>niichan</i>...!

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:00.370
Found you!

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:02.960
This time, you must be the real Yamanbagiri!

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:11.150
It looks like the gods are on my side.

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:14.380
I still have one shot left.

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:15.800
The gods, huh?

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:19.470
In that case, I have no choice!

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:21.560
What?!

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:28.200
You trusted too much in
your own skill, so now you lose.

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:35.790
On our team we've still got us and Horikawa.

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:38.910
The other side has two
left--Izuminokami and Urashima.

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:41.240
We can win this easily, right?

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:43.310
Are you sure you wanna say that?

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:55.550
A-Are you Urashima...?

00:17:56.090 --> 00:18:00.800
You shouldn't think of him
as the Urashima you know.

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:03.600
This guy's lost his two older brothers,

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:06.400
and is standing here
after overcoming his sorrow.

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:10.780
Hachisuka-<i>niichan</i>, Nagasone-<i>niichan</i>...

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:15.030
For warriors, the more sorrows they overcome,

00:18:15.240 --> 00:18:16.930
the stronger they get!

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:20.620
I will definitely not lose!

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:23.450
He's fast!

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:26.210
He's dodging as he advances?

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:37.160
What the...?

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:45.180
Then I should retreat for now!

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:46.520
I won't let you get away!

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:49.980
Kunihiro, huh?

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:54.390
Kane-<i>san</i>, let's decide this.

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:02.480
Here I come!

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:08.330
Kunihiro, if you keep running away,
you won't be able to defeat me!

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:12.380
Here I come, Kane-<i>san</i>!

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:19.300
Kane-<i>san</i> really is strong.

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:22.010
That was pretty good.

00:19:24.940 --> 00:19:25.960
Where?

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:27.780
Where is he?

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:32.270
A sniper? Who?! 

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:33.110
So cold!

00:19:34.120 --> 00:19:35.260
All right!

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:39.610
Uguisumaru?!

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:42.530
What were you doing in a place like that?

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:45.870
I was secretly watching
Ookanehira from here.

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:50.590
Kane-<i>san</i>, prepare yourself!

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:51.930
This is bad!

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:55.790
What are you doing?

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:57.880
Oh, Uguisumaru-<i>san</i>, sorr--

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:01.580
You have to finish things properly, Kunihiro.

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:07.030
Kane-<i>san</i>, you really are strong...

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:16.860
Wow, that's cold! What the--

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:19.030
I won't miss next time! Wait!

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:21.030
What are you all playing at?

00:20:21.240 --> 00:20:22.660
Take that!

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:29.150
Akashi!

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:31.120
Oh, what is it, Kashuu?

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:33.780
Wait, what are you doing?

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:35.670
I won't let you get away!

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:38.850
Wait!

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:44.430
Kiyomitsu!

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:46.300
You're the only one left!

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:47.330
Izuminokami?

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:49.390
Was Horikawa defeated?

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:52.430
The stilts were fun, weren't they?

00:20:52.430 --> 00:20:53.860
Yeah!

00:20:53.860 --> 00:20:55.230
Huh? Kashuu-<i>san</i>--

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:55.850
Get outta the way!

00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:06.030
Over there, huh?

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:13.160
Huh? He's not here.

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:14.710
Where'd he go?

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:15.830
Over here.

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:18.630
Hey, hey, hey!

00:21:24.680 --> 00:21:27.930
Man, we were outwitted by Kiyomitsu.

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:30.010
I thought we had won, too.

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:32.850
I haven't been living here
the longest for nothing.

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:36.230
Even so, your quick thinking was amazing!

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:40.360
Your plan to use
Brother's cloth was also excellent.

00:21:40.570 --> 00:21:42.400
I was fooled by it.

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:45.770
Anyway, Kashuu and the
others came to win from behind!

00:21:46.530 --> 00:21:48.740
I wish Yasusada could've seen it, too!

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:49.870
Yeah!

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:54.330
Um, here's a certificate!

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:56.420
Kashuu Kiyomitsu-<i>dono</i>!

00:21:56.420 --> 00:22:01.210
This shows that you showed
admirable quick thinking and strength

00:22:01.210 --> 00:22:03.090
in the water gun group battle.

00:22:03.090 --> 00:22:05.130
You were really amazing!

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:09.350
Ha-ha!

00:22:09.720 --> 00:22:10.520
Thanks.

00:22:12.430 --> 00:22:13.680
Jeez.

00:22:16.350 --> 00:22:17.390
All right, I'm done.

00:22:20.730 --> 00:22:24.000
I've gotten stronger, too, Yasusada.

00:23:55.030 --> 00:24:01.590
"More <i>Hanamaru</i> Next Week!!"
